  "original_product_snapshot": {
    "id": 2796,
    "name": "bunny bag DONATION",
    "type": "physical",
    "sku": "BUN",
    "description": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Our popular Spring Fundraiser is back! Help a wonderful local organization with the purchase of our adorable bunny grab bags! <br /><br /><strong>This bag is a great option for kids!<br /><br /></strong>**Please note that photos don't necessarily represent what will be in the bag. Please see descriptions below for accurate contents. Muslin bunny bag designs vary.&nbsp;<strong><br /></strong><strong><br />BADGER SLEEP&nbsp;BALM </strong>bag contains: a mini Badger Sleep Balm&nbsp;tin along with an Eco Candle Co. tea light, stickers and soap sample. All packaged in a reusable muslin bunny bag.<br /><strong><br />LIP BALM </strong>bag contains: a Crazy Rumors vegan lip balm along with an Eco Candle Co. soap sample, stickers, a mini rubber duck, a micro rubber duck and seed paper to plant&nbsp;your very own wildflower garden. All packaged in a reusable muslin bunny bag. A great Easter basket stuffer&nbsp;for kids!<strong><br /></strong><br /><strong>INCENSE MATCHES </strong>bag contains: a book of incense matches, an Aromaland essential oil tester (*note this is a partially filled bottle to sample), an Eco Candle Co. soap sample, matchbook, stickers and two soy&nbsp;tea lights. All packaged in a reusable muslin bunny bag.&nbsp;<br /><br />All bags contain at least $12 worth of product and ALL the profits go to <a href=\"https://krsmallanimal.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">K&amp;R Small Animal Sanctuary</a> in Appleton, WI! K&amp;R rescues, rehabilitates, and re-homes rabbits, guinea pigs, and other little critters. They depend solely on donations and volunteers to do this work and we are thrilled&nbsp;to give back to this great, local organization. Our owner's bunny, Feta, was&nbsp;from K&amp;R!&nbsp;&nbsp;<br /><br />We only have a limited quantity, so grab 'em before they are gone!&nbsp;</p>",
